  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. Cut pumpkin into thin wedges. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Place pumpkin on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with Nan's special seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.\n• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak. TIP: Peel the pumpkin if you prefer!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657a6aaca65f6d71569fc088-c41a857f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium saucepan, heat the plant-based butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook garlic paste, until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Add basmati rice, the water and vegetable stock powder, stir, then bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid.\n• Cook for 10 minutes, then remove from heat and keep covered until the rice is tender and the water is absorbed, 10 minutes. TIP: The rice will finish cooking in its own steam so don't peek! ~~~~~~~~~~ MODULAR STEP ~~~~~~~~~~",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657a6aaca65f6d71569fc088-51981fd7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, thinly slice red radish. Thinly slice cucumber into rounds. Roughly chop baby spinach leaves. Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• In a medium bowl, combine radish, cucumber, baby spinach and a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season.\n• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi, until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657a6aaca65f6d71569fc088-7fc67698.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide garlic rice between bowls. Top with smokey roast pumpkin, haloumi and radish salsa.\n• Top pumpkin with plant-based smokey aioli and chimichurri sauce.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-657a6aaca65f6d71569fc088-90ec8fb2.jpeg"
    }
  ]
